WEBVTT

00:27:58.131 --> 00:28:03.219
and sustainable development
impacts and safeguards.

00:28:04.011 --> 00:28:05.555
So let me unpack those a bit.

00:28:05.555 --> 00:28:06.723
Additionality.

00:28:07.432 --> 00:28:12.186
Additionality means
that the emission reduction or emission

00:28:12.228 --> 00:28:16.941
wouldn't have happened
without the revenue from carbon credits.

00:28:18.151 --> 00:28:23.698
Permanence means that those reductions
and removals will stand the test of time.

00:28:24.615 --> 00:28:28.077
And if they don't,
they will be fully compensated.

00:28:28.828 --> 00:28:32.123
An example of that
would be a forestry project